id: inverted-shadow
name: Inverted Shadow
# A Racial Factor: what it asks for, shown beside its Factor Trait and never enforced (the user's).
requirement: Shadow Dragon
maximumFactor: 1
prerequisites: N/A
description: >
  Whether you were created by a selfish wish, or you were purified by some means after your creation, one thing is certain- as surely as light casts shadows, you are cast by darkness, a beacon of hope amidst the inky black void of your draconic kin.
